                                "sense_id": "28eaf4ca-18ca-394e-b18e-c7404f961b3b",
                                "text": "The bathers they wore looked sort of the same as now, but their hair was really different."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "654cfa8a-28a0-495a-8fb7-571ee55d1c2e",
                                "sense_id": "28eaf4ca-18ca-394e-b18e-c7404f961b3b",
                                "text": "No one here wore bathers. Both boys wore their homemade underpants, the brand name, ‘Sydney Flour’, emblazoned across the back, as old flour bags were not wasted, but recycled."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cee5e05f-2918-4b02-82c6-96244a14cf31",
                                "sense_id": "28eaf4ca-18ca-394e-b18e-c7404f961b3b",
                                "text": "I was looking at a pair of bathers to buy and talking about the life of the bathers and how to extend their life."
                            }
                        ]
